ping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\">Gaping Wounds</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-164&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-167</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/25px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/38px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/50px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lann Tarv\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/25px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\">Lann Tarv</a> on the main floor</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Z%27rell\" title=\"Z'rell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Z%27rell.png/25px-Portrait_Z%27rell.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Z%27rell.png/38px-Portrait_Z%27rell.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Z%27rell.png/50px-Portrait_Z%27rell.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disciple Z'rell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Z%27rell.png/25px-Portrait_Z%27rell.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_Z%27rell.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Z%27rell\" title=\"Z'rell\">Disciple Z'rell</a> needs to be convinced to give additional aid in finding Ketheric's relic.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Psychic Steel Virtuoso:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Psychic Steel Virtuoso works only for attacks made by a weapon with this Psychic Steel Virtuoso.</li>\n<li>Psychic Steel Virtuoso requires an attack to have Advantage prior to the attack being made, and as such will not function with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reckless_Attack\" title=\"Reckless Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reckless Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-fil